<BaseLayout
  title="DiffusionOPD: Multi-Task RL for Diffusion via On-Policy Distillation | AI/ML Deep Dives"
  description="DiffusionOPD solves multi-task RL for diffusion models by training specialist teachers independently, then distilling them into one student along its own denoising trajectories — using a closed-form KL that eliminates PPO's variance."
