<div class="section-no">03 — Two-Stage Architecture</div>
<h2>Train specialists, then distill in parallel</h2>
<p>DiffusionOPD adapts OPD's recipe to the diffusion setting with a two-stage training paradigm that cleanly separates single-task exploration from multi-task integration.</p>

