<h2>State-of-the-art on all three benchmarks</h2>
<p>DiffusionOPD achieves the best multi-task average score (0.929) across all evaluated methods — while requiring substantially less training compute than the nearest baseline, Cascade NFT (0.851 average, 148 GPU hours vs ~97 GPU hours for DiffusionOPD).</p>

