<h3>Distillation method comparison</h3>
<p>DiffusionOPD also outperforms alternative ways to distill from the same set of specialist teachers. The comparison is controlled: all methods receive identical teacher models and training data, and all use on-policy student rollouts except SFT (which trains on teacher-generated images).</p>

<div class="results-bars" id="dist-bars">
